                                                                                
 Usage: mokioclaw [OPTIONS] COMMAND [ARGS]...                                   
                                                                                
 mokioclaw: a teaching-first mini CodeAgent. Use `mokioclaw "task"` for Rich    
 output or `mokioclaw tui` for Textual TUI.                                     
                                                                                
╭─ Options ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│ --workspace           -w      PATH                Workspace for generated    │
│                                                   files. Defaults to a fresh │
│                                                   .mokioclaw/workspaces/wor… │
│                                                   directory.                 │
│ --max-attempts                INTEGER             Maximum                    │
│                                                   planner/actor/verifier     │
│                                                   attempts before            │
│                                                   finalizing.                │
│                                                   [default: 3]               │
│ --approval-mode               [inline|auto|deny]  Human approval mode for    │
│                                                   high-risk BashTool         │
│                                                   commands: inline, auto, or │
│                                                   deny.                      │
│ --checkpoint-mode             [light|strict|off]  Checkpoint mode: light,    │
│                                                   strict, or off.            │
│ --trace-mode                  [on|off]            Trace logging mode: on or  │
│                                                   off.                       │
│ --resume                      PATH                Resume from an existing    │
│                                                   MokioClaw workspace.       │
│ --skill                       TEXT                                           │
│ --execution-backend           [local|docker]                                 │
│ --workflow-mode               [full|light|auto]                              │
│ --install-completion                              Install completion for the │
│                                                   current shell.             │
│ --show-completion                                 Show completion for the    │
│                                                   current shell, to copy it  │
│                                                   or customize the           │
│                                                   installation.              │
│ --help                                            Show this message and      │
│                                                   exit.                      │
╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯
╭─ Commands ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│ cancel       Cancel a foreground run while keeping detached Subagents        │
│              running.                                                        │
│ send         Queue a correction for a running foreground task.               │
│ rewind       Preview file-tool changes; --apply restores matching files.     │
│ tui          Open the Textual terminal interface.                            │
│ compact      Compact a saved session or request compaction of a running      │
│              Agent.                                                          │
│ trace        Read existing traces, optionally following new records; never   │
│              execute work.                                                   │
│ doctor       Check backend availability without executing a model request.   │
│ daemon       Manage the local MokioClaw Agent daemon.                        │
│ subagent     Inspect and control daemon-managed Subagents.                   │
│ permissions  Inspect or revoke user-owned project approval rules.            │
│ eval         Prepare and independently grade the frozen internship code      │
│              tasks.                                                          │
